  <h1>Terms of Service</h1>

  <p>Mona Moon Content is a content management application used to create, organize, manage and publish social media content for the Mona Moon digital brand.</p>

  <p>By using this application, users authorize only the permissions they explicitly grant through connected platforms such as TikTok. These permissions are used solely to provide content management and publishing functions.</p>

